     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nThe introductory workshop, conducted via Zoom, 10-21 January 2022 is beginning to fill. If you would like to participate in discussion of distance sampling methods and implementation as well as carry out analyses in R weekdays 1500-1730 UK time, be sure to\r\n register before the registration deadline on <span style=\"color:rgb(200,38,19)\">\r\n<b>06 December</b></span>.<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<div>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;box-sizing:border-box;height:61px;width:778px;text-align:center\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<td style=\"width:352px;border-color:transparent transparent rgb(146,192,224);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;box-sizing:border-box;height:60px;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;text-align:center\" align=\"center\">\r\n<span>Complete details and a link to the registration page</span><br>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color:transparent transparent rgb(146,192,224);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;box-sizing:border-box;height:60px;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;text-align:center\" align=\"center\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><a href=\"http://workshops.distancesampling.org/intro-jan-2022.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://workshops.distancesampling.org/intro-jan-2022.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472700850000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2wnnO8iLahSKImNFRfC4lf\">http://workshops.distancesampling.org/intro-jan-2022.html</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>At the webpage above, you will find a link to the St Andrews online shop where payment is made.  After registration, I will contact you with additional details regarding workshop electronic materials, etc.</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<span>Feel free to contact me with questions and share this announcement with interested colleagues 🧑‍🔬.</span><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">Eric Rexstad</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(12,100,192)\">Centre for Research into Ecological and Environmental Modelling</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">University of St Andrews</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Registered Charity in Scotland SC013532</span><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><br>\r\n</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
